                            <p>
                                SeeShell is the Swiss-army knife of desktop automation and
                                <a href="/seeshell/desktop-Automation">Robotic Process Automation (RPA)</a>.
                            </p>
<p>
                                <img src="~/Content/Images/seeshell-desktop-automation-rpa.webp" alt="Desktop Automation and RPA with SeeShell" class="responsive-img">
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                It is used from simple personal automations projects
                                such as scripting and online banking login to large corporate business process automation projects.
                                <a href="/seeshell/desktop-Automation">Read more about Image-Driven Automation with SeeShell...</a>
                            </p>
